1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,540
Peptidi nisu steroidi.

2
00:00:01,830 --> 00:00:02,881
I to nije sitnica,

3
00:00:02,881 --> 00:00:04,283
nego potpuno drugi način

4
00:00:04,283 --> 00:00:05,860
na koji se priča s tijelom.

5
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:07,270
Steroid je sila.

6
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:08,670
Ulazi u samu ćeliju,

7
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:09,650
sve do jezgra,

8
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:11,260
i mijenja šta ona radi.

9
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:12,747
Peptid je signal.

10
00:00:12,747 --> 00:00:14,577
Kratak lanac aminokiselina

11
00:00:14,577 --> 00:00:16,196
koji pokuca na površinu

12
00:00:16,196 --> 00:00:17,674
ćelije, preda poruku,

13
00:00:17,674 --> 00:00:18,660
i razgradi se.

14
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:19,546
Čekić.

15
00:00:19,546 --> 00:00:20,340
I ključ.

16
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:22,771
Tvoje tijelo ovim jezikom

17
00:00:22,771 --> 00:00:24,227
govori svaki dan:

18
00:00:24,227 --> 00:00:25,854
inzulin, oksitocin,

19
00:00:25,854 --> 00:00:26,368
GLP-1.

20
00:00:26,368 --> 00:00:27,910
Sve su to peptidi.

21
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,167
Zato kod peptida nije pitanje

22
00:00:30,167 --> 00:00:30,980
koliko jako,

23
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:32,201
nego koliko tačno.

24
00:00:32,201 --> 00:00:33,218
Čista molekula.

25
00:00:33,218 --> 00:00:34,100
Tačna poruka.

26
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:35,641
Sačuvaj ovo za sljedeći

27
00:00:35,641 --> 00:00:37,000
put kad ih neko pomiješa.

